# The MSI's payload (docs/14 "App", ADR-019). Built, never committed:
#   recly-capture-helper.exe  — cargo build --release, windows/capture-helper
#   ffmpeg.exe + *.dll        — an LGPL shared build (windows/README.md)
#   recly-events.exe          — go build, events/ (docs/14 "Agent connection")
# `.github/workflows/windows.yml` puts them here before `packageMsi`.
recly-capture-helper.exe
ffmpeg.exe
ff*.exe
*.dll
recly-events.exe
